  "description": "Yijin couldn't have lucked out more, getting a job working for the charismatic Joohyuk, one of the most influential figures in the restaurant franchise industry. He's the perfect boss\\* until Yijin catches Joohyuk kissing a man and finds out he's gay. But when his father gets in trouble with debt collectors, Yijin turns to Joohyuk for a huge favor. As a businessman with prior experience in such matters, Joohyuk agrees to help... but he wants something physical in return?!\n\n(Source: TappyToon) \n\nMain story: 1-41 + Prologue\nSide stories: 42-81",
